== Evoker fangs ==
{{About|the evoker fangs in {{MC}}|evoker fangs in {{MCD}}|MCD:Evoker Fang}}
{{Infobox entity
| title = Evoker Fangs
| image = Evoker Fangs.png
| imagesize = 85px
